  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Analysis - Support to improve women&apos;s right to land through the &quot;BUSAC Model&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this consultancy agreement is to:
Make an assessment of the need and potential for upscaling the model pioneered by BUSAC with regard to expanding women&apos;s de facto access to own land. this includes an analysis of what the constraints and opportunities are for the model as well as an action plan for the Danish Embassy, which shows what actions and interventions are needed, when they are needed, as well as an overview of the financial support needed to ensure successful implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
